2. FEATURE CONCEPT
==================================================

Partner Picks is a reciprocal merchant-to-merchant
product collaboration system.

It allows merchants to establish partnerships and
display selected products from partner stores across
different areas of the YUME ecosystem.

The system must be based on mutual cooperation,
permissions, negotiated placement positions,
reciprocal exposure, and configurable subscription
entitlements.

IMPORTANT DISTINCTION:

Partner Picks is NOT the future paid advertising
system of YUME.

Keep Partner Picks architecturally independent from
future paid advertising campaigns, sponsored ads,
and advertising billing.

Partner Picks should feel like a natural extension
of YUME's social-commerce experience.

It must not make stores or browsing experiences
look like intrusive advertising platforms.

