==================================================

Partner Picks must reference original products.

Do not duplicate product records.

The original merchant remains the product owner.

The partner storefront displays the original product
information through a controlled reference mechanism.

Study how to handle:

- Price changes.
- Image changes.
- Description changes.
- Product deactivation.
- Product deletion.
- Out-of-stock products.
- Product visibility changes.
- Product category changes.

