12. PARTNER ROTATION
==================================================

A merchant may have multiple partners.

However, all partners must not appear simultaneously.

Initial agreed rule:

Maximum TWO partner stores visible at the same
time, subject to Platform Admin configuration.

Example:

Refresh 1:
Partner A + Partner B.

Refresh 2:
Partner C.

Refresh 3:
Partner D + Partner E.

Refresh 4:
Partner B + Partner E.

DEFAULT ROTATION:

Rotate partner stores on page refresh.

OPTIONAL ROTATION:

Platform Admin may enable timed rotation.

The administrator can configure the number of
seconds between rotations.

Timed rotation must be disabled by default.

Rotation must not require a complete storefront
reload.

Study how to implement rotation without causing:

- Layout shifts.
- Repeated impressions.
- Excessive requests.
- Poor performance.
- Unfair exposure distribution.

The maximum simultaneous partner stores must
be configurable from Platform Admin.

